# 수리수리 (MyoDoc) — iOS

> Renamed from the original working title *Eyelog (아이로그)* — the prior name was already registered as a trademark, so the app now ships as **수리수리** (Korean display name) / **MyoDoc** (English display name).

An iPhone app for parents/guardians to monitor their children's **axial length (AL)** measurements collected at myopia-management clinics registered on [myopiamanage.org](https://myopiamanage.org), with a built-in **community board (자유게시판)** so parents using the service can share advice and questions with each other.

The axial-length viewer side of the app is **read-only**: all clinical data is pulled from the existing myopiamanage.org PostgreSQL database via mobile-specific API endpoints under `/api/mobile/*`. Parents cannot enter measurement data themselves — only clinicians who operate on the web do. The community board is **read-write** for any signed-in app user.

> **Branding:** Korean display name **수리수리**, English display name **MyoDoc**. The brand-blue palette (`#0d47a1`) and logo lockups match the web site at myopiamanage.org. Source SVGs live in `MyoDoc/Resources/` and are referenced from `Assets.xcassets` as `BrandLogo`, `BrandLogoEnglish`, and `BrandMark`.

> **Status:** Scaffold / specification repo. No production build yet.

